@type Severity
@kind enum
@purpose Error / Warning / Info / Hint. Pattern-matched; no ordering relation is defined. [src: diagnostic.aria:10-14]
@antipatterns Callers cannot compare severities numerically — every level must be matched explicitly if you want "at least Warning" semantics. [src: diagnostic.aria:10-14]

